Package: kulan-welcome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), flatpak
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings (= @VERSION@), gufw, deja-dup
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Setup Assistant
 Opens once at first sign-in. Choose your look and privacy settings, bring
 over files from another computer, add popular apps and see which
 protections are on.
